  "liner": {
   "body_md": "## Setlist highlights\n\n- **Into the Woods**: back after 38 archived shows (419 days); rare: 12 archived performances [5]\n- **I Needed it Most**: rare: 9 archived performances [5]\n- **Picture of You**: back after 43 archived shows (432 days) [5]\n- **By My Car**: rare: 13 archived performances [5]\n- **Butch Cassidy**: rare: 8 archived performances [5]\n\n## The recordings\n\n- **mmj2006-12-29** (recommended): source not stated; 26 songs; 142 min; rated 4.67/5 by 3 [1]. Said about its sound: The recording quality is acceptable, though it suffers from significant background chatter throughout [2]\n\n## Around the show\n\n- The Fillmore venue was surprisingly empty because many attendees waited for a bigger weekend event [2]\n- The reviewer yelled during the start of this track, which was a rare appearance since 2002 [3]\n- The reviewer expressed strong affection for this specific song during the performance [4]\n- Tickets cost half the price of the upcoming New Year's Eve show at the same venue [3]\n\n## Tapers and lineage\n\n- **mmj2006-12-29**: source: Schoeps CCM-4's->Aerco->SBM-1->M1 (FOB) [1]. Also: Audio captured with Schoeps CCM-4 mics, processed through Aerco and SBM-1, then ripped to FLAC [1]",
